00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.160
I'm sure your boy's got what it takes.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.200
You survived that.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.240
Where is he?

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:36.280
He's in a farmhouse just northwest of here called Carmody Dell.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:40.340
It's just up the train tracks as you're heading up towards Fort Wallace.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:44.380
There's also some money in that house, but that's your business, not mine.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:45.420
But don't kill nobody.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.460
Folks know we ain't intimate no more, and they'll know it was me.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.500
